  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scholarship program for hydropower students - partnership agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot scholarship program, in a public-private partnership. Grant funding is used to offer scholarships for qualified students, enabling them to attend the Hydropower Development Master Program at NTNU. Private sector partners contribute with supervisors and internships for the exchange students. Combined, this will build relevant academic and practical experience amongst candidates from developing countries. The aim is to facilitate local recruitment in hydropower development projects.</narrative>
  </description>
